window.products.push({"id":1163033,"name":"PakOne Professional Countertop Blender, High speed blender with 1800W Base,SUS 316 Stainless-Steel Blades, Smoothies Maker with 74 Oz BPA-Free Big Cap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hGPYEo7fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Upgraded Latest Model】 PakOne is committed to making small kitchen appliance for years,our blender is popular in the market which is the latest model with professional power and modified materials. It adopts upgraded 9535 electric motor in the base, which can whip berries and fibrous veggies into a silky-smooth texture, and it can even blend chia seeds smoothly. 【SUS 316 Stainless Steel Blade】Our PakOne blender come with SUS 316 sharp & strong blades that stand the test of time and are able to pulverize just about anything, which makes it much safer to clean. The high power 1800W blender can reach a maximum speed of 26000rpm. This also makes food more delicate and smooth. 【High-capacity Blender Jar】This high-power blender comes with 74 ounce(2.2L) high-capacity jar. It is lightweight and made of BPA-free plastic which can withstand the high-speed blades. The jar is perfect for making smoothies,fruit shake and milk shake for the whole family. Besides, it has 10 variably speed settings and its heavy duty base won't easily move on the counter when in use. 【Easy to Clean】This PCTG jar with a wide mouth to facilitate loading and cleaning. Take the jar out from blender motor base and then pure, or add a little clean agent with water into jar, and then use“Pulse”button to run the jar as several circles. This makes sure no food bits are left behind in hard-to-reach spots. 【2 Years Warranty】 Your home appliances are fully warranty against defective components and manufacturing faults for a period of 2 years from the date of registered purchase,during this period a defective product or parts will be repaired without charges.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hGPYEo7fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PakOne","source_asin":"B08TMBT9KS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163033","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TMBT9KS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TMBT9KS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
