window.products.push({"id":1163050,"name":"Kacebela BBQ-4.5inch-Black Instant Read Collapsible Probe Digital Meat Thermometer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JIfLWRboL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Do you have the experience that when you cut open a delicious looking steak, but to find that the food is overcooked or undercooked? If you have, I believe our meat thermometer is an effective solution to solve that problem. Just insert instant-read thermometer with high precision sensor probe into the food or liquid you are checking and you can get the accurate temperature within 4-6 seconds! It can be used for meat and food cooking, barbecue, candy, baking, tea, coffee, milk, bathing water, etc. A really practical and versatile device for every kitchen! Key Feature: - Hold feature - Practical folding mechanism - Plash water protected rate: IP55- Celsius/Fahrenheit switchable - It is workable with the probe at any angle between 45-180° Instructions: - Pull out the probe to turn it on - Insert the probe into the food or liquid a couple of centimeter, then the readouts will be displayed on the LCD screen -Press \"Hold\" button, then it will remain temperature value until you press the meat thermometer again- Fold the probe, then the food thermometer will be shut offProduct Specifications: Response Time: 4-6 seconds Measurement range: -58℉-572℉ (-50℃-300℃) Key operation: MAX/MIN, ℃/℉ Temperature resolution: 0. 1℃C/0. 1℉Power supply: LR44 battery (included) Stainless steel probe: 304 3. 5x80mm Important Notes: - Clean the metal probe in soapy water - Sterilize metal probe by inserting it into boiling water for several minutes- Do not leave food thermometer in oven while cooking. Do not touch hot probe with bare hands. - The folding probe is with a sharp tapered end, please fold away when not in use and keep it out of reach of children","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JIfLWRboL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kacebela","source_asin":"B07W5S1BF7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W5S1BF7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W5S1BF7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
