window.products.push({"id":1163083,"name":"renemos Ice Cube Trays for Freezer with Lid, Stackable Silicone Ice Cube Tray No Spill & Easy Release, Firm Plastic Frame and Flexible Silicone Cavity","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iBQlM5VML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🏅【INGENIOUS DESIGN】We know exactly the bummer you had before on the traditional easy cracking plastic ice cube mold or the entire silicone ice tray but way too pliable to move to freezer or punch out cubes all at a time. This craft ice molds is well-balanced with thick-reinforced plastic frame and flexible silicone cavity, easy to fill in water directly under faucet with single hand and shake with a tilt when it is full, then it’s done to move to freezer. ♻️【SAFTY MATERIAL】The entire ice cube molds and trays cavity is made of food-grade silicone material, non-toxic and BPA free, there is no plastic or joint of plastic and silicone, which is safe not only for daily use but also can be applied for baby food. 24 nice-sized silicone ice cube trays with lid can keep ice cubes from absorbing freezer odors. Classic slim shape efficiently for narrow space in freezer and stackable. 🌠【EASY RELEASE & CLEAN】This pink ice cube tray with each cube compartment separates from another makes it easy released by simply push from the bottom, no hard bending, no awkward twisting. Rinsed with running water for easy cleaning. Dishwasher Safe. 🥂【GOOD BACK UP】This whiskey ice mold bring you tons of delicious options for iced cocktails & coffee, frozen fruit juice & beverage, manageable pre-made baby food and much more! It is a good back up for summer. It is a must-have kitchen gadget “an ounce more costs, a pound more satisfied.” 👩‍🔧【RISK FREE SERVICE】A variety of color ice cube trays with lids embellish your joyful life. If you experience an issue with renemos product, get in touch with us for a repair or replacement. We’re grateful for the opportunity to learn from your experience to improve our products. Package included: 1 x Ice trays for freezer with lid.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iBQlM5VML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"renemos","source_asin":"B09MJF79WM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163083","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MJF79WM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MJF79WM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
