window.products.push({"id":1163156,"name":"KEYSTONE 4.5 HP Self-Cleaning Hand-Held Indoor/Outdoor Dry Vac, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IoH5ObZ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Keystone SMARTVAC self-cleaning, handheld dry vac features a fine dust filter with 2-stage filtration with a self-cleaning filter system. The 2-stage filtration system consists of a pre-filter and a post-filter to provide a clean, safe home environment by capturing 90% of particles down to 0.4 microns including cold ash and fine dust. The innovative filter cleaning system reverses the air flow to keep the 2-stage filter clean, insuring peak performance and dramatically increasing the life of the filter. Lightweight, powerful and portable, SMARTVAC makes quick work of dry messes either indoors or outdoors and is great for cleaning your car. Using the 16-ft. power cord, 3-ft. hose with a permanently attached wand, crevice tool and 2-inch upholstery tool, you'll have the leeway to get to any mess in the car, workshop or house.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IoH5ObZ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KEYSTONE","source_asin":"B00Y10RO3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y10RO3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y10RO3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163157,"name":"Music is What Feelings - This is Not Vinyl Decal or Peel Stick - Easily Tak-it-Up with Plasti-Tak provided Removable Paintable Art Wall Décor Gift Quo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TA+ltti5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Not a decal !! “But how do they stick?” Each pack includes a 1/2 oz pack of ‘PLASTI-TAK’ our re-usable adhesive putty. Simply apply a small piece (or roll into thin string shape) of PLASTI-TAK onto the back of the word in 2-3 spots and press & stick to ANY surface Not only does this make our product unique, it is also versatile, allowing you to move the quote from wall to wall with ease leaving no stains or sticky residue, we like to call this “no mess, no fuss!” home décor. Each word is laser-cut from thick mat board and can be painted, glitter-fied, bedazzled and bejeweled! Easy-to-use Directions: To remove, grip item with two hands and slide it down slowly, the non-drying Plasti-Tak will release. Pack arrives ready to use. Guaranteed Removable Repositionable Paintable, paint the back and place it on a mirror for a cool 3D effect, so get creative. Use on a dry wall, hardly any prep required. Our suggested size does not stop you from placing the words in any form or direction to fill your desired space, so get creative No damage to painted walls Leaves no sticky residue Quick to apply Safe and easy Budget-friendly Ideal for Long Term or Temporary use NOT a vinyl decal… looks like a decal, sticks up like a poster - 1/16 inch matte board Textured walls NO problem - no squeegee, tape, rulers or pulling off liners involved!!!! Use carefully on poor quality painted walls i.e. primer only Why Tak n Stik Wall Décor and Quotes Our products solve almost all the 1 star reviews on decals in that you don’t have the difficult issues sticking them up. Give your space an instant make-over with Tak n Stik quick and easy to use matboard Wall Decor. Designed for quick and easy application, every pack includes about ½ oz of our revolutionary non-drying adhesive putty specifically formulated over 40 years. Use carefully where the wall only has a weak primer base paint on the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TA+ltti5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tak n Stik","source_asin":"B07RQF2GZG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163157","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RQF2GZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RQF2GZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
