window.products.push({"id":1163442,"name":"DILIBRA 2 Packs Acrylic Display Stand for Figures, 9-Tier Clear Acrylic Risers Display Shelf, Round Collectibles Display Stand Organizer Holder for Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IUYWDuMVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"I guess it's every child's nature to like to collect a lot of pop figures even as they grow up. But when the collection grows, you have to face the cluttered desk or drawer. Are you still trying to find creative ways to display your cute item without looking tacky or overcrowded? DILIBRA Acylic Display Riser Stand is the best partner for your favourites! Showcase your beloved collectibles with a minimalist design and let them shine on the ‘stage’ you set up. ◾Specification: Color: transparent Material: high-quality acrylic Product Size: as shown in the picture ◾What's Included in The Box: Including 18 columns, 18 round plates, 16 oval plates, 2 screwdrivers, 22 short screws and 14 long screws. ◾Shape Transformation: The oval acrylic plate at the bottom can be rotated, and you can arrange it into various shapes according to the size of the cabinet space or your own preferences. ◾How To Install? 1.Please tear off the protective film on the acrylic plate. 2.Connect the arylic column to the round plate with short screws, repeat nine times. 3.The other end of the column is connected with the oval plate, the holes at the extreme ends use short screws, and the holes where the two oval plates overlap are used long screws. 4.Adjust it to the shape you want and you're done! ◾Multi-purpose 9 Tier Rack They do fit POP figures just right. Would be a great way to display them outside of the box.This staggered display holder is also great for displaying cupcakes, cosmetics, perfume, cupcakes, watches, necklaces, bracelets, collectibles, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IUYWDuMVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DILIBRA","source_asin":"B0B187ZSSR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B187ZSSR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B187ZSSR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
