window.products.push({"id":1163464,"name":"Pink Lily Flower Glass Coffee Mug Tea Cup,Birthday/Mother's Day Gifts for Mother/Wife/Daughter/Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tmpnLcpvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✤ [NOT ONLY A MUG BUT A ARTWORK]:This beautiful glass cups’ all the color enamels are entirely hand painted by artists with centennial art heritage. So this mug is not only a normal liquid container, but also an artwork and collection for your home. ✤ [WITH A NICE SPOON ]:Each handmade tea mug comes with its own matching spoon, so that you can add sugar to your tea and coffee and stir it thoroughly with ease and style. The matching spoon is stainless and it can withstand the temperature of hot drinks, so don’t be afraid to use it, even if your beverage is boiling hot. ✤ [BEAUTIFUL GIFT AND DECORATIONS]:Great gift for family, friends or that special someone, Collect for your own use as well. The clear, translucent glass mug will become your favorite glassware, and it can even be used as a decorative piece for your kitchen and house. The handmade glass mug is also a great wedding, engagement, anniversary, Christmas and birthday valentine's day gifts. ✤ [HIGH QUALITY TEA CUP]:Made of Heat resistant glass, This mug is entirely blown by manual with lead-free glass, instead of made by machine, There are no contamination to the liquids inside, which will be more healthy for human body. It uses advanced bonding process, the metal and jewelry on the glass will never fall off.13oz Capacity, Included: 1 * Glass Mug , 1 * Spoon, 1 * Drink Coaster , 1 * Cleaning Cloth. ✤ [SPECIAL STYLE CUP YOU DON’T WANT TO MISS]:European classical style .This mug is retro, vintage, elegant and luxurious, which will improve your lifestyle and artistic accomplishment. It is Handmade, it doesn’t mean that this glass mug is too delicate, don’t worry about that ,any problem or question, please feel free to contact with us first!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tmpnLcpvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GXONE","source_asin":"B07L4JHRXL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L4JHRXL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L4JHRXL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163465,"name":"Kaisa Big Fluffy Blanket 10' x 10' Large Throw Blanket 120” x 120 Huge Blanket Soft Smooth Cozy Plush Flannel Oversized Blanket Flannel, Outdoor Blank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FTGAu3GCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"120\" x 120\" Super Size: The blanket is almost twice the size of a standard full-size blanket while still supporting machine wash. It's so huge that you can easily enjoy a cozy and happy Sunday afternoon with your family or friends snuggled under it watching a movie and your pet dozing off on it. Soft And Cozy Fabric: Made of high-quality polyester flannel, the blanket is super soft and shiny, keeping you cozy and warm all year around. It also features no fading, no shrinkage and no lint, thus avoiding deformation and discomfort for a longer life. The neat and tight stitched edges add extra durability and refinement. Perfect Gift: Vacuum packed in a very nice box, the blanket expands immediately upon opening. Its luxurious texture, huge 10' x 10' size and soft touch can readily capture the heart of the box opener. There is no better gift for housewarming, birthdays, holidays, Christmas, and other events! The recipient will truly appreciate the gift! Indoors & Outdoors: Unlike regular blankets, this blanket consists of 3 pieces; a 10' x 6' center piece and two 10' x 2' side pieces. Thanks to its huge size and chic texture, the blanket can be perfectly integrated with your room decor, completely covering a king-size bed and draping down around it, or laying on a sofa with the rest cascading to the floor for your pet to doze off. In addition, its large size but light weight also makes it a good choice for outdoor camping, picnics and travel. Hassle-Free Care: Simply machine wash on a gentle cycle with cold water. Tumble dry low. DO NOT dry clean or iron. Do not use any chlorine-based cleaners. Kaisa believes in our products and backs them with a lifetime warranty. If you have any issues, please contact us and we will resolve your concerns to your 100% satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FTGAu3GCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kaisa","source_asin":"B0B48QY2TJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163465","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B48QY2TJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B48QY2TJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163466,"name":"G.a HOMEFAVOR 3-Tier Hanging Fruit Basket, Paper Rope Woven Vegetable Storage and Fruit Organizer - Kitchen Countertop Space Saver - Chain Adjustable ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RERvn8QXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【3 TIER HANGING STORAGE BASKET】: This three set woven round basket is made of heavy duty wire and renewable round paper rope which it can be recycled 100%, and it can be biodegraded. The open design lets air circulate, and the basket allows fruits and vegetables to breathe to ensure fresh ingredients. The fruit or vegetable in every basket could be clearly display at a glance. 【VERSATILE WOVEN HOLDER】: Kitchen storage organizer is perfect as hanging basket for fruits or vegetables, or as wall hanging planters or flower pot holders. Store your favorite bulk or bagged fruit, vegetables, snacks and plenty more in the woven basket. Baskets are compatible with kitchen, dining room, supply room and guest room hang on a hook from the ceiling or a strong rod for saving countertop space in your home. 【EASY TO SWITCH DESIGN】: Extra chain with hook can extend the chain to adjust the chain to a suitable height or interchangeable with the top bowl to serve as a banana hanger. Each Detachable bowls can be used as stand alone veggie and fruit organizers. 【UNIQUE TEXTURE】: The basket is constructed of a steel wire frame for sturdiness and a tightly woven paper rope. Each product is hand-woven by our professional weaving workers. Each one is a special gift. Paper rope fruit basket adds an attractive modern boho decor and elegant element to any room. 【MEASUREMENTS INFORMATION】: Overall hanging height 37 inches which can be stretched to 50 inches. The diameter of every basket that from top to bottom is 7 inch, 9 inch, 11 inch. All three are 3.5 inches depth to help you storage your kitchen items neat and organized. This hanging baskets holds fruit to the capacity of 20 pounds. No other assembly is required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RERvn8QXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G.a HOMEFAVOR","source_asin":"B08T5QNFN7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163466","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T5QNFN7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T5QNFN7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
