window.products.push({"id":1163484,"name":"Diamond Ice Cube Trays with Lid, 2Pcs Premium Silicone Ice Cube Molds for Bourbon, Cocktails, Whiskey, Ice Cube Maker for Freezer, BPA Free, Easy Rele","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XPFDO9ZIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"✿【Romantic Diamond Ice Cube】: Our diamond ice cube molds can make beautiful clear diamond shaped ice cubes (size:1.97*1.38”(L*H). They are perfect for chilling your favorite drinks, whiskey, bourbon, scotch, cocktail, beverage, juice, etc. Adding romantic and fun touch for your drinks.. ✿【Great for All Occasions 】: These fantastic ice cubes melt slowly. They can keep your drinks cold without watering them down. Get these ice cube tray set, be ready for parties, drink night, date night, girls’ night out, family gatherings, summer patio cookouts and more. ✿【Multifunctional Use】: Our diamond ice cube tray is not only used to make ice cubes, but also be used for making chocolates, jelly, ice cream, soap and more. Great gift for mother, girls and friends. ✿【BPA Free Food Grade Silicone Material】: Unlike traditional plastic ice trays, these ice molds are made of premium silicon, flexible, soft, easy to remove, and will never crack. The cold and heat resistance is from -40℃(-40℉) to 230℃(446℉). It is safe to put these ice cube molds & trays to microwave oven and dishwasher.. ✿【Easy to Use and Remove】: Just lock the lid and base tightly, and then use the included funnel to fill it to the closed top. The trays are non-stick. The ice cubes can be easily popped out with ease.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XPFDO9ZIL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Filymosie","source_asin":"B08PBRNSSP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PBRNSSP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PBRNSSP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163485,"name":"Hullo Buckwheat Pillow (Small Size - 14x20)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xFU7RLKRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Popular throughout Asia, buckwheat pillows have helped many people get more restful sleep. Buckwheat hulls are firm yet highly malleable and breathable, which makes them ideal pillow fill. Hullo conforms to your body and provides cool, comfortable, all-natural support. Typical pillows are unable to provide adequate support and collapse under your head, which can strain your neck and back muscles and interfere with restful sleep. By adjusting the shape and thickness of Hullo, you create perfect support for your neck and head. This removes stress from your spine. A buckwheat pillow’s malleable quality helps support the space beneath your neck, keeping your spine straight and allowing your neck and back muscles to completely relax. Many people are pleased to discover how something as simple as a pillow can have such a positive impact on their sleep. Adjust the thickness and malleability of Hullo by adding or removing buckwheat hulls anytime. Hullo ships fully stuffed, so you'll have plenty of buckwheat hulls to get your pillow just how you like it. Traditional pillows retain body heat, making your pillow uncomfortable, particularly during the hot summer months. The lack of air flow prevents warm air from escaping your pillow's fill. Hullo's buckwheat hull fill allows air to move freely through your pillow, preventing uncomfortable heat build up. Sleep on the cool side of the pillow all night long without flipping. From the 100% organic cotton twill case, to the carefully sourced and selected buckwheat hulls, we make our buckwheat pillows in the U.S.A. with the finest materials available. Our premium buckwheat hulls are grown and milled by American farmers. Buckwheat pillows contain no animal products for those interested in a vegan lifestyle. Hullo has been featured by Martha Stewart, Home Beautiful, Architectural Digest, Elle Decor and Men's Journal.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xFU7RLKRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hullo","source_asin":"B01DJJ5YMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163485","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DJJ5YMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DJJ5YMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
