window.products.push({"id":1163516,"name":"WOSOVO Set of 2 Kitchen Cabinet Organizer and Storage Shelves Stackable Expandable Storage Racks with Anti-slip Liners for Cabinet Pantry, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GXLyd2d8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Steel, Plastic VERSATILE DESIGN: Our cupboard shelf organizer works three different ways to give you maximum versatility when counter or cabinet space is limited. Use the two included racks separately for elevation and two-tier storage, side-by-side (such as along a connected cabinet shelf) as an elongated storage solution, or stacked for three levels of storage (Note: remove the rubber feet of the “top” shelf before stacking). CONVENIENT IN THE KITCHEN: Whether you slide them under overhanging cabinets or set them up with seasonings stove side, these storage racks are well-scaled and fit in seamlessly. Use the top to place taller bottles and canisters at your fingertips and tuck smaller jars away underneath until they’re needed. They’re a fast, easy way to keep your countertops clutter-free as you prep, mix, measure, and cook. USEFUL HOME STORAGE: These storage racks are great in the kitchen, but they work elsewhere in the home too! Use them on the bathroom counter to hold your toothbrush cup above the soap, or stack washcloths underneath. Use these racks in your home office to organize pen cups and other desktop items, keeping your work-from-home space tidy. The thoughtful rubber-tipped feet ensure these expandable storage racks won’t scratch surfaces. DURABLE MATERIALS: Welded for longevity, each rack in this pair is finished with a rust-resistant coating, ensuring it still works well around steam and water. Each rack can hold up to 20 pounds of items on its upper shelf, so load it up with your heaviest jars, canisters, and other everyday necessities - it’s built to last! Special plastic liners are also included for the top shelf spaces to keep your items from sliding or slipping off. EACH RACK SET INCLUDES: 2 metal cabinet organizer racks, 8 rubber feet (removable design). As a special gift with purchase, your metal countertop storage shelves will also come with 2 plastic shelf-top liners, which help close the gap between the bars for storing smaller items. No assembly is required to use these convenient racks - just set and/or stack, load up, and enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GXLyd2d8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOSOVO","source_asin":"B08GK7ZLLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163516","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GK7ZLLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GK7ZLLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
