window.products.push({"id":1163621,"name":"AMOAMI-Bath Mat-Super Absorbent Quick Dry Bathroom Mats for Bthroom Floor-Rubber Backing Machine Washable Thin Bahtroom Rugs Fit Under Door-Bath Rug i","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NFRvlXcqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABSORBENT & Quick Dry：Super Absorbent bathroom rug. 100% high-end terry surface, made of extra dense and short fuzzy fibers. Provide twice absorption than normal polyester or polypropylene bathroom mat. Moreover, short fuzzy fibers dry remarkably quickly. ANTI-SLIP & IMPERMEABLE: Heavy-duty textured rubber backing make sure the bathroom floor mat stays in place on a smooth and wet bathroom floor. Waterproof backing prevents water from penetrating the bath mat and wetting the floor. Moreover, rubber backing is more durable and won’t be smelly after long-term use. MACHINE WASHABLE: Easy clean bath mats for bathroom designed to save your time. It’s machine washable and even vacuum-able using low suction. No fading, no shedding, no tearing. Maintains excellent plush even after multiple washes! AESTHETIC&COMFORT: 3D embossed simple pattern adds style and personality to your exquisite bathroom space. This bath mat with improved technology makes the surface softer, cozy and skin friendly, giving your feet a warm place to rest on the cold tile. LOW PROFILE & FLAT: Thin bathroom rug fit under door. Proper thickness for robot vacuum cleaner and wheelchair. Rolling package without stubborn creases. No shedding, no pilling and no fading will happen. It can be laundry room mat, kitchen mat, pet feeding mat, desk mat, in front of sink mat, rv bath mat etc","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NFRvlXcqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMOAMI","source_asin":"B0BMTCHCSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMTCHCSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMTCHCSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163622,"name":"Architec Concave Acacia Carving Board, Gripperwood Collection with Non-slip Gripper Feet, 13 by 19-Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P9icHm4nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Gripperwood Concave Carving and Cutting Board collection from Architec combines two innovative elements to bring you a carving and cutting board that you will reach for first and use for years to come. The Gripperfeet on the concave boards assures you a slip-free work surface; the patented gripper technology was introduced in the Original Gripper Boards, a plastic cutting board with over 300 gripper feet on the back of each board. The Concave shape of these boards allows you to carve and cut your meat without worrying about the jucie overflowing on your counter. The difference between traditional carving boards that catch juice in the perimeter trough, is the Architec's concave shape allows the meat to stay with its juice while it rests, ensuring a moist and tender cut. All Architec Concave boards will hold up to 1 Cup of liquid, so not one drop of that flavor filled juice will go to waste! The COncave Carving and Cutting Board collection features a variety of woods, from beautiful, rich and dark Acacia wood to a more classic blonde Beechwood. All of our wood cutting boards should be hand washed in warm soapy water, soaking in water is not suggested and never wash in the dishwasher. For longer lasting performance and beauty, it is reccommended to periodically apply a light coating mineral oil with a soft, clean cloth. The Architec brand offers an assortment of frequently used kitchen items which were created by applying basic principles of architecture & engineering to improve their beauty and function; resulting in a better experience in the kitchen for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91P9icHm4nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Architec","source_asin":"B07QXMF2S9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QXMF2S9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QXMF2S9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163623,"name":"Series Tablecloths Ancient Celts Seasons. Winter - Stability. 16х16 Cloth Wicca Pagan Witch Shawl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UXJ98I9wL._AC_.jpg","description":"Series tablecloths Ancient Celts Seasons. Winter - stability. Cloth Wicca Pagan Witch shawl Series tablecloths Ancient Celts. Seasons. Winter. Cold, icy cold and at the same time, the purity of the world, which stood in front of you in its splendor. Since ancient times, it is believed that image, symbol, figure, which is adjacent to attract into our lives the energy that is applied to it. Winter - the stabilization, preservation and order. Winter - is the ability to soothe, or organize something that happens in life. Size 40x40 cm – 16х16 inch. Cloth. The highest quality. Resistant to dirt. Easy to wash in the machine. 100% satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UXJ98I9wL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonderworld","source_asin":"B00ON8HGFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ON8HGFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ON8HGFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
