window.products.push({"id":1163779,"name":"XccMe 20oz Skinny Sublimation Tumblers,8PACK Straight Stainless Steel Double Wall Insulated Blanks with Lids,Shrink Wrap Films,Straws,Individually Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610CKemZImL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"XccMe 20oz Sublimation Straight Skinny Stainless Steel Tumbler meets your life needs, adds color to your life, and releases your design talents. It is also the best choice for your gift. 🥤Feature: ❄Material：304 stainless steel,double walled vacuum insulated. ❄Size: Sublimation Straight Skinny Stainless Steel Tumbler:21cm/8.2in*7.5cm/3in Shrink Wrap Films:25.4cm/10in*12.6cm/5in ❄Capacity: 20OZ ❄Color: White ❄Splash-proof cover:Sliding cover prevents spillage and is straw-friendly. 🎁 Thoughtful gift set: 8 Pack Sublimation Straight Skinny Stainless Steel Tumbler 8 Pack Splash-proof covers 8 Pack Shrink wrap films 8 Pack Independent packing boxes 🥤Steps to make a sublimation water tumbler: 1. Select the picture design from the computer. 2. Use SAWGRASS sublimation printer to print out the design. 3. Cut into the sublimation paper and wrap it on the straight tumbler. 4. Full wrap with shrink wrap film, adjust to the suitable temperature in the oven and wait for a few minutes to get the perfect printed tumbler. 🥤Applicable equipment: sublimation paper, SAWGRASS printer, thermal tape, mug press or oven, heat shrinkable film, hot air gun. ⚠NOTE:If your Straight Skinny Stainless Steel Tumbler have done sublimation, in order to protect the printing perfect on the tumbler.It is not recommended to use the dishwasher to clean it. You can use a soft sponge to clean the tumbler, so that the tumbler printing pattern can be protect well. 🥤Applicable Occasion： This personalized design tumbler can be given to relatives, friends, colleagues, etc. It is the best choice for birthdays, Mother's Day, Father's Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving and other holidays. It can also be used at parties, picnics, offices, wedding parties to enrich your life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610CKemZImL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XccMe","source_asin":"B0BGK69KHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163779","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGK69KHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGK69KHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
