window.products.push({"id":1163781,"name":"Belle House Vacuum Cleaner, 4 in 1 Corded Stick Vacuum 20000pa Powerful Suction, with HEPA Filter Lightweight Vacuum for Home Hard Floor Pet Hair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tuslXkzsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Lightweight & Multi-purpose & LED lights Floor Head - The vacuum cleaner has a lightweight body, extremely suitable for one-hand cleaning. 2 in1 bush tool or long crevice tool can be switched into a handheld vacuum to pick up debris on the desk or in the gap between the car's seats; Retractable metal tube for adjusting the height can use for cleaning dust or spider webs on the curtains or ceiling. 6 Stages High-Efficiency Filtration System - Equipped with double cyclone filtration system - density sponge, high-efficiency filter, Dust bucket filter, HEPA filter, stainless steel strainer, and double cyclone separation, captures 99% of the microscopic dust and locks in small particles without leakage, hence protects the motor from overheating because of blockage and also expels purified air. Note: Regular cleaning of the filter and sponge can prevent weak suction and blockage 180° Rotation Flexible Floor Head & Two Storage Methods - Maneuverable 180° swivel sideways and 90°up and down lets you more easily clean your house in all directions. The wireless vacuum support easy storage methods - wall-hanging design, effectively save space and improve your living comfort. 20000pa Super Suction:Cordless vacuum maximum suction power is 1.8 times that of ordinary electric cordless vacuum cleaners. With a strong suction of 240000pa, a 250W high-performance digital motor can provide cordless cleaning performance, can be thoroughly cleaned within 30 minutes, and provides high performance on hardwood floors, carpets, walls, curtains and furniture. 40 Minutes Long Lasting Runtime: Up to 40 min of fade-free runtime. Easily switch to MAX power on fingertip controls to increase suction for better cleaning on carpet and rugs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tuslXkzsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belle House","source_asin":"B08R3QZCNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R3QZCNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R3QZCNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
