window.products.push({"id":1163784,"name":"Plastic Cutting Boards for Kitchen - Colorful Flexible Cutting Mats for Cooking With Ventilated Storage Stand - Anti-Skid BPA-Free Chopping Mats for F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZSNVqcXmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Colorful Cutting Boards Make Food Prep Safer: These colorful cutting board mats will help you keep a clean, hygienic, and sanitary kitchen; Each plastic cutting board is a different color and comes with a food icon at the top, so keeping raw and cooked food separated will be a piece of cake Made of Durable, Food-Grade Plastic Without BPA: Each cutting board mat is made from BPA-free, food-grade plastic with a waterproof, anti-skid texture; Although these are flexible cutting boards for kitchen, they're tougher than a two dollar steak and can handle the sharpest knives Available in 2 Styles That Both Come With a Stand: Set 1 features a Gray Vertical Ventilated Stand and 4 boards that each measure 13.8 x 9.4 inches - Red with Fish Icon, Blue with Apple Icon, Yellow with Pig Icon, and Green with Chicken Icon; Set 2 features a Black Horizontal Ventilated Stand and 4 boards that each measure 11.8 x 8.4 inches - Red with Cow Icon, Blue with Fish Icon, Yellow with Chicken Icon, and Green with Carrot Icon Great Gift for Foodies, Home Cooks & Pro Chefs: No matter your skill level in the kitchen, our plastic cutting board mats are sure to make meal prepping, cooking, and serving simple and smooth; The plastic cutting board set comes in a ready-to-wrap box and will make the perfect present for birthdays, holidays, housewarming parties, and other special occasions We Make Cooking Easier & More Fun for Everyone: Food has a unique way of bringing people closer together; That's why our mission is to develop products that help you whip up something magical in the kitchen for your loved ones; You're important to us, so if any questions or concerns come up; we're here ready to assist you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZSNVqcXmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIDELITY SYSTEMS","source_asin":"B0B8MBJBWF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8MBJBWF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8MBJBWF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163785,"name":"Navaris Glass Beverage Drink Dispenser - 5.5 Liter / 1.5 Gallon - Ice Cold Punch Bowl Glass Container - Drinks Stand with Tap Lid - Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rueGCBmbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Navaris Glass Beverage Drink Dispenser - 5.5 Liter / 1.5 Gallon - Ice Cold Punch Bowl Glass Container - Drinks Stand with Tap Lid - Clear","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rueGCBmbL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Navaris","source_asin":"B079H34B1F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163785","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079H34B1F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079H34B1F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163786,"name":"Snake Bite Bottle Opener Bar and Bartending Tool, The Mamba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C48VczcML._AC_SL1332_.jpg","description":"Product Description The patent-pending Mamba by Snake Bite Co. is the next evolution in the Snake Bite family. This professional bottle opener and bar tool is a solid construction of ceramic tumbled, 304 stainless steel. It embodies a unique design that incorporates four functionalities guaranteed to improve your game. The Mamba will arrive in a black foil-stamped kraft gift box with securing bands and instruction card that, without a doubt, will make a statement. As always, the Mamba and all of it's packaging is 100% sourced and proudly made in the USA. From the Manufacturer Bottle Opener/Can Venter The Mamba speed bottle opener function looks straight forward on the surface but has been designed as a four-way opener. This means that regardless of which way you're holding the tool it will work and open any pry-off or twist off bottle cap – making it one of the fastest and easiest to use openers on the market. Caps traditionally create a significant amount of wear on cheap nickel-plated openers that end up rusting over time. The Mamba is 100% solid 304 stainless steel and will last a lifetime. Can venting (or Snake Biting) is a tried and true way to let air into your container while beer is making it's way out. This results in a smoother and faster pour while eliminating a significant amount of air that is typically ingested while drinking directly from a can. Pour Spout Remover/Tab Lever Pour spouts are a great way to make a fast and accurate drink but can be a pain to remove once the bottle is empty. Some bottles (and all liquids with sugar content) develop a hard to remove seal that can slow down service and distract you from making your next drink. The Mamba's pour spout remover uses lever action to easily remove the most stubborn pour spouts without damaging the bottle or spout. Try it once and you'll never go back. Opening a can isn't thought of as being all that difficult – but if you are opening dozens a night – it can easily take a toll on your hands and fingernails. We developed the can tab lever to quickly pry up stubborn can tabs on every type of can. Even if you are only opening a few, you'll quickly realize that it's an incredibly useful action. Patent Pending Design The Mamba’s patent pending design is 100% unique in the world. From the ergonomic lift of the tool to the double fangs, you won’t find anything else like it. 100% Sourced and Made in the USA We’re very proud to have every Snake Bite Co. product, including the Mamba and all of it's packaging, 100% sourced and made in the USA – in our hometown shop located in St. Louis, MO. Built To Last We pair the best materials with the most talented craftspeople to create the highest quality products that will last a lifetime. We designed a bottle opener and that bottle opener built this brand. We build products and apparel for the happy hours, the after hours, and the weekend - all the times when you are ready to enjoy life. As Snake Bite Co. grows and evolves three tenets guide and ground us: Quality, Consistency, and Good Times. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Legendary Bar Tool How did you come up with the idea for this product? When we launched our first project, The Original Snake Bite, we really had no idea how successful it would become. Over the past year we've had bartenders, breweries, restaurants, chefs, distilleries, mixologists and weekend warriors using their Snake Bites personally and professionally around the world. After months of feedback one thing became clear: Everyone loved their Snake Bite and they wanted a bigger, badder, and more \"venomous\" version and that’s when we decided to design The Mamba. What makes your product special? The Mamba design is not only patent pending, but also a ton of fun to use. We’re drawing a line in the sand for other brands that claim to be something they’re not and making our mark with everything we build; 100% sourced and handcrafted in the USA. What has been the best part of your startup experience? Seeing our products out in the “wild” without knowing the person. That is an awesome feeling that never gets old and it makes our day every time it happens.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51C48VczcML._AC_SL1332_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Snake Bite","source_asin":"B01IWGQGBU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IWGQGBU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IWGQGBU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
