window.products.push({"id":1163833,"name":"LifeStyle Solutions Morgan Loveseat, Navy Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":218.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wuX62aVAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Morgan Loveseat by Lifestyle Solutions is the perfect addition to your home or living space. The Morgan loveseat, seats two people comfortably and constructed with thoughtful design. Elegant and modern with comfortable cushions immediately invite you to relax and reflect. The Morgan has an easy to care for and gentle soft polyester fabric that comes in many colors and complements any space and décor. Under the soft and gentle polyester is quality high-density foam, pocket coils and Dacron wrapping all with you in mind to provide you the most comfort. It is built with a wood base frame to ensure sturdiness for years of enjoyment. The Morgan loveseat comes in black, green, navy blue and yellow. Whichever color you choose, the Morgan Loveseat by Lifestyle Solutions will always stand out in your room and give you the pleasure of the modern feel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wuX62aVAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifeStyle Solutions","source_asin":"B0BBZDDQWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBZDDQWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBZDDQWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163834,"name":"Glass Coffee Mugs,Double Wall Insulated Glass Mugs with Handle,Clear Glass Coffee Cups Set of 2, Insulated Glass Mugs for Coffee, Tea, Latte, Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jrkIUGaDL._AC_SL1412_.jpg","description":"\"All double-walled thermo glasses are mouth-blown and handmade. Our mouth-blown thermo glasses are handmade, heat-resistant, scratch-resistant and dishwasher-safe. The thermal glass is stylish and functional at the same time - the mouth-blown double-walled glass with its excellent insulating properties makes it possible! Heat-resistant borosilicate glass is used in the production process. It is light and filigree, yet robust enough to meet the high demands of everyday usage. Thanks to the insulating effect made possible by the air between the layers of glass, hot drinks such as coffee or tea stay hot longer and cold drinks stay cold longer. In addition, the double-walled glass ensures that the outer glass is always at a constant temperature, so that even possible burning of fingers is a thing of the past. Another effect: no annoying condensation water, thus no annoying edges on the table when enjoying cold drinks. In the production process, two glass balloons are blown into shape, brought together, deburred, fired and cooled down again. This creates a small hole at the bottom of the glass. At the end of production, this is closed with a special adhesive and cured under UV light. This seal subsequently serves as an overpressure membrane and regulates the pressure equalisation when the air in the double wall is heated and expands. All double wall glasses are unique due to the manual production and can differ slightly in shape and size. Features DimensionsColor box packaging, Gift 350MLHeight: approx. 11.3 cm;Diameter: approx. 8cmCapacity: 350 ml/12 OzA Set of 2 250MLHeight: approx. 9 cm;Diameter: approx.8 cmCapacity: 250 ml/8 OzA Set of 2 220MLHeight: approx. 9.5 cm;Diameter: approx.8.2 cmCapacity: 220 ml/7 OzA Set of 2 150MLHeight: approx. 8cm;Diameter: approx.7.5 cmCapacity: 150 ml/5 OzA Set of 2 Warm notice: The Double Wall Insulated Therm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jrkIUGaDL._AC_SL1412_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B09JSN43QX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JSN43QX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JSN43QX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
