window.products.push({"id":1163863,"name":"A-ER-FA Queen Size Air Mattress with Headboard , 3 Mins Quick Inflation/Deflation Inflatable Airbed , 20 Inches High Blow Up Bed with Comfortable Floc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716iR1UCtdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Exquisite Home New flocked fabric: AERFA inflatable bed top is made of flocked fabric and 0.4mm PVC. Innovative removable air headboard - 3-section backrest closer to the human body design, neck and waist more comfortable, double placement cup hole design, you can place cups and other small objects, snap connection, Can be disassembled or installed at any time. New technology: inflatable mattress with a new generation of tension structure design, evenly distributed pressure, stable support. The bottom enlarges the skirt to act as a suction cup, so the air mattress has enough stability to maintain a high load-bearing capacity, and the mattress rolls over the problem. Max Weight Capacity: 700lbs Fast inflat and deflat: AERFA inflatable mattress is equipped with a high-powered air pump, It only takes 2 or 3 minutes to witness the magical moment of the air bed blowing up. High-frequency seam technology can effectively prevent air leaks so the mattress will stay plump all night. Wide range of use: This amazing combination can be considered an ideal gift for your family and friends, for travel, tent camping, hiking and backpacking.  Feature PVC Material User Friendly Design Powerful Air Mattress Pump Convenient to Carry Multi purpose Package 1 Air Mattress 80 inch X 60 Inch X 20 Inch(QUEEN) 1 Inflatable headboard (backrest) 2 Air Pillow 1 Electric air pump(3 nozzles) 1 Storage bag 1 Instruction manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716iR1UCtdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"α阿尔法","source_asin":"B09MVJ5957","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163863","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MVJ5957","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MVJ5957","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163864,"name":"Johnson Brothers Old Britain Castles Pink Covered Sugar Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bJERUwKOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description This historical and traditional pattern, Old British Castles, intricately rendered by a Miss Fennel back in 1928. She, the daughter of a Master Engraver, created these original drawings from old book photographs and steel engravings. OBC is certainly one of the best known patterns from Johnson Brothers and has been in production since 1930. Each piece of china depicting a scene of a different castle has extended to 45 castles. Some of the most famous castles included in the OBC Pattern are - Cambridge, Dunstable, Exeter, Haddon Hall, Kent, Stratford, and Warwick. The Old British Castles pink sugar -- use it everyday or for your most formal settings. A delicate work of art this sugar bowl imparts sophistication of high tea to an everyday ritual. Additional accessory items available in this pattern. Amazon.com Johnson Brothers has been making fine English tableware for over 100 years. Much loved by collectors and Anglophiles the world over, its classic Old Britain Castles Pink pattern is not only beautiful but also offers a historical tour of an empire. From Stratford-on-Avon to Penshurst Place and Kenilworth Castle to Blarney Castle, each piece depicts different panoramic scenes of great architectural monuments and the landscapes that surround them. Intricate ornamental borders of flowers and leafy scrolls surround the pieces and bring the disparate array of scenes harmoniously together. This 1-cup covered sugar bowl measures 6 inches from handle to handle, 4 inches wide, and 4 inches high. Rose tints and gently scalloped edges give these dishes a delicate feel, while their durable design makes them suitable for everyday use. Dishwasher-, microwave-, and freezer-safe. --Erin Brown","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bJERUwKOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Johnson Brothers","source_asin":"B00005098Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163864","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005098Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005098Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
