window.products.push({"id":1163871,"name":"Newspin 100% Waterproof Mattress Encasement,Zippered Cal King Mattress Protector Bag,360° Protection - Soft Breathable Noiseless Mattress Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613m28CygOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Plastic 【100% Waterproof Mattress Encasement】: Newspin cal king waterproof mattress encasement is designed to protect your expensive mattress. The bottom layer is a high-quality TPU waterproof membrance to prevent liquid from entering the mattress. The mattress encasement cal king size waterproof can effectively protect against all liquids, including accidental spills, such as coffee, juice,making a good sleeping environment. (Iron, bleach and dry clean will damage the waterproof backing) 【Zippered Mattress Encasement】: The zipper waterproof mattress encasement with zip guard secures the mattress.California King size zipper mattress encasement :72\"x84\"x15\", it is suitable for all mattresses of 10\"-17\"deep pocket,it is designed for all types of mattresses including memory foam, latex or spring.The highly elastic band has excellent ductility to accommodate mattress of various thicknesses to prevent the mattress from moving. 【Breathable & Noiseless Mattress Encasement】：Our cal king mattress encasement waterproof is made of double-brushed microfiber fabrics and delicate craftsmanship, combines breathable layer and super soft material perfectly, keep the mattress dry and soft.Meanwhile, the waterproof mattress encasement zippered is beneficial to the breathing of the skin and healthy sleep. And they are silent, do not make plastic sound when you move on your bed. Suitable for baby,kids,junior and elderly adults. 【Machine Washable Mattress Protector】: Our waterproof zippered mattress protector encasement is machine washable in cold water, supports low temperature drying,easy to clean, and guaranteed to be smooth and tidy after washing. When getting up, you can make the bed quickly and easily to keep your room clean, tidy and beautiful. Save your precious time.You can buy two or more pieces cal king mattress encasement so that after one is cleaned, the other can continue to protect the mattress. 【Widely Used & Lifetime After-sales】: The zipper mattress encasement cover is lightweight, suitable for home, dorm, hotel and portable packing for travel. Newspin is specialized in the production of household products, especially bedding. If you have any question of this mattress encasement zipper, please feel free to contact us. We will reply to the email within 24 hours .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613m28CygOL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Newspin","source_asin":"B08LNPD3R3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163871","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LNPD3R3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LNPD3R3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
