window.products.push({"id":1163952,"name":"THAT! Heat That Warming Dip Bowl and Hot Plate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/219Pn67jviL._AC_.jpg","description":"Heat THAT! Dip Bowl and Hot Plate keeps dips delectably hot and tasting their best for over 30 minutes. Just pop the silicone-insulated base into the microwave for 60 seconds, place it under the matching ceramic bowl, and enjoy every last gooey morsel. Never settle for dip gone cold again. Dishwasher safe. At THAT! we believe that through good engineering, even the simplest of things can be made better. Our goal, our mission, our obsession is to create new tools to make life in the kitchen just a little bit easier. How do we do it? We think up new solutions to old problems, and then we throw away the ones that don't simplify. That's why so many of our products are made without batteries, wires, or moving parts: whether it's cutting-edge materials or a fresh design concept, if an innovation doesn't simplify, it just won't last. And if it doesn't last, it's not worth buying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/219Pn67jviL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"That! Inventions","source_asin":"B01FX1B6TE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FX1B6TE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FX1B6TE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1163953,"name":"VellaWorld Bubble Cube Candle, Room Decor Aesthetic Candles Bulk, Handmade Aesthetic Soy Wax Relaxing Candles, Cute Cube Shaped Small Home Decorative ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619AjVyARDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VellaWorld is dedicated to make high-quality decorative candles with natural ingredients. This beautiful candle is an art piece no matter where you look, a delightful addition to your home and a heart-warming gift to your friends and family.Product Details: Size: 6x6x6cm / 2.36x2.36x2.36 inch Cube Material: 100% Soy Wax Colors: ? White ? Light Blue ? Light Purple ? Light Green ?Light BrownProduct Features;? Quality Material:Our candles are hand-poured with 100% soy wax blend for clean burning. Without any bad chemicals, safer, healthier and longer lasting. Easy to light and trim.? Ingredients:Handmade with all natural premium-quality soy wax. This blend gives excellent robustness, scent throw, and burns longer than ordinary candles. It is also a great .? Nice Decoration:Stylish and on trend, our soy wax bubble cube candles are handmade and will add that extra elegance to your decor. Clean and simple and a lift to any space, helping you enjoy a simplistic and classy touch anywhere.? Great Gift: Perfect gift idea for housewarming, wedding, birthday, baby shower, Christmas,Valentine, Thanksgiving, and other occasions.?Burning State and Time:The wick is centered and straight to maintain its burning state and its special appearance. It does not soot and burns 2.5 times longer than other paraffin candles.x Note:Due to the different monitor and light effect, the actual color may be a little different from the pictures.? Warning:Keep out of reach of children and pets.Avoid flammable objects or areas with drafts.Always close within sight, do not leave unattended.Keep candles at least 3 inches away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619AjVyARDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VellaWorld","source_asin":"B099KG1T7G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1163953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099KG1T7G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099KG1T7G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
